  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil kettle. Fill a large saucepan of salted boiling water.\n• Cook fusilli in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 12 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2 people / 1 cup for 4 people) then drain and return to pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf324/step-f93aaf00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Grate carrot. Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste and tomato paste, and cook, until fragrant, 30 seconds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf324/step-30e3ec10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium-high. Add passata, reserved pasta water, vegetable stock powder, the butter and brown sugar to frying pan. Cook, stirring, 2-3 minutes.\n• Transfer cooked pasta and sauce to a medium baking dish, stir to combine and season. Sprinkle the Cheddar cheese over pasta bake.\n• Grill until cheese had melted, 5-8 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf324/step-15738120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, tomato, carrot and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Divide cheesy plant-based mince bolognese pasta bake between plates. Serve with garden salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fb0d0527cba53bf324/step-35cec730.jpg"
    }
  ]
